.git
# Consumed elsewhere (demo/backend) via a raw file: link to this checkout, alongside other
# packages that expect a single shared react-i18next/i18next instance (e.g.
# mirador-annotation-editor). This own dev-installed copy would otherwise shadow the shared one
# and split React Context identity, breaking useTranslation() across package boundaries.
node_modules/react-i18next
node_modules/i18next
